               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Uses for the temporary relief of arthritis pain in the following areas: • hand • wrist • elbow • foot • ankle • knee</paragraph>
